sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Model
    participant H as Harness
    participant D as Disk
    participant P as Human
    M->>H: tool call (verdict: ask)
    H->>D: save checkpoint + pending call
    H->>P: review card
    Note over H: run stops: awaiting approval
    P->>H: approve, edit or reject
    H->>D: load saved state
    H->>M: decision as the tool result
    Note over M: model carries on
